cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this proof or its checkers, cite this archive and the original conjecture."
title: "Penttila–Storme Conjecture 5.6: all odd extension degrees"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "A computer-assisted proof that, for q equal to two to an odd power, a flock generalized quadrangle of order (q squared, q) containing the specified Segre Tits subquadrangle is isomorphic to the Payne flock generalized quadrangle. The proof reduces the unrestricted field-size question to equality of two regular languages and verifies that equality by exact finite closure."
